      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "动作还是满僵硬的呢。\n要适度放掉一些力气，让动作流畅优美。\n你照这个要领动动看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b6fe444d479c53570bd5326f423a5b3bd58e5caf33ff773971dd05a29bbe66a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
