      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "做发声练习时也要注意姿势。\n出声的时候，用跟走台步时一样的感觉，\n像是朝远方拉出一条直线那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b5a412a5aa7eb19ef6c5d382d4932ec2ab718d4c83798b856045e09d25544f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
